  "definition": "Required Action After Mechanical Breakdown or Other Failure of a PORS",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-07-24",
  "historyNote": "#9572, INTERIM, eff 10-21-09, EXPIRES: 4-19-10; ss by #9660, eff 2-24-10; ss by #12582, eff 7-24-18",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
  "notation": "Env-Dw 1206.04",
  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1200.html",
  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1206.04 Required Action After Mechanical Breakdown or Other Failure of a PORS",
  "priorExpiration": "2010-04-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1206.04 Required Action After Mechanical Breakdown or Other Failure of a PORS.\n\n(a) If the PORS experiences a mechanical failure, water main break, or power failure or experiences an unexplained change in the water quality in the PORS, the PORS O/O shall initiate, as appropriate to the situation:\n\n(1) Disinfection;\n\n(2) Bacterial testing;\n\n(3) Flushing;\n\n(4) Public notice to consumers; or\n\n(5) A combination of one or more actions identified in (1)-(4), above.\n\n(b) The action(s) taken shall be determined by the PORS O/O after a careful analysis of the event.\n\nSource. #9572, INTERIM, eff 10-21-09, EXPIRES: 4-19-10; ss by #9660, eff 2-24-10; ss by #12582, eff 7-24-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1200.html"
}
